(thrust-vector)
*title Table-driven thrust vector
*atmos none
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0
*trajectory 1 vehicle start on 1
  *initial ecfc x=20925646.3255 y=0 z=0 xdt=0 ydt=0 zdt=0 time=0 mass=10
  *file thrust-vector.dat time thrust ep1 ep2 xecfcdt yecfcdt zecfcdt
  *segment 1 burn
    *integ dtprnt=0.25 dt=0.025
    *inertial ecfc
    *prop thrust=(vector-thrust) mdot=(zero-mdot) ep1=(vector-angle-1) ep2=(vector-angle-2)
    *fly yawi=0
    *fly pitchi=0
    *fly rolli=0
    *when time=3 stop
*end
